&lt;p style="margin-left: 42px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;※Scope2：自社施設における電気・熱の使用に伴う間接排出量&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 42px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;※集計対象：MJS単体&lt;/p&gt;
